        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2013",
        "question_text": "<p>The volume of a fixed mass of gas is 400 cm\u00b3 at 27\u00b0C. What will be its volume at 127\u00b0C if the pressure remains constant? (Assume ideal behavior)</p>",
